    <briefdescription>
<para>Tests to verify that the XTC plugin is fully compatible with Gradle&apos;s configuration cache. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These tests ensure that:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Tasks work correctly with configuration cache enabled</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Task execution results are equivalent with/without configuration cache</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No configuration cache serialization issues occur</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Build performance is maintained </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
